<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian May yr/yr inflation 1.7 pct vs 1.5 April.</title>
<headline>Austrian May yr/yr inflation 1.7 pct vs 1.5 April.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, June 23, Reuter - The Central Statistics Office</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	     MAY	 APRIL	 MAY 1996**</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.3	  0.0	    -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     1.7	  1.5	     1.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1996)	    101.5	101.2	   129.9</p>
<p>NOTES -- ** base 1986. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
